  "diff_read": "complete signed semantic diff, 69 insertions / 10 deletions in one parent",
  "contracts": [
    "Actual poll_reset returns stored reason or typed connection error; state is not consumed, so synchronous repeated observations on terminal paths are supported.",
    "Waiting upstream read races actual reset observation. Closed capacity and final sends consult the same actual send stream; InactiveStreamId alone never counts as success.",
    "Observed CANCEL succeeds; other observed reasons become typed H2 errors, and concrete existing peer-gone I/O kinds remain allowed teardown.",
    "poll_reset backend includes stored Reset, GoAway and scheduled-reset state; observed CANCEL does not independently prove exclusively remote wire RST_STREAM provenance.",
    "Noop-waker probes occur on terminal paths that immediately return; no pending receive/capacity operation resumes relying on their overwritten waker.",
    "Recorder error owns original H2 error; its source borrows the original get_io payload. Backend Error::source is empty, not evidence that backend lost its payload. Non-I/O H2 errors return unchanged.",
    "Original recorder poison control requires any typed I/O cause, not its exact kind/text. Existing INTERNAL_ERROR reset, postexchange PermissionDenied and healthy EOF controls remain unchanged.",
    "Two immediate nonfallible closures become ordinary blocks; no ?/return behavior was changed inside those blocks."
  ],
